# Riskin Tracks — site mode toggle
#
# CONSTRUCTION MODE (current): redirect all paths to the under-construction page.
# LIVE MODE: comment out or delete the /* line below, then commit and deploy.
#
# Local dev (localhost) is unaffected — Netlify applies _redirects on deploy only.
#
# Quick toggle:
#   Construction → keep this line active:
#     /*    /under-construction.html    200!
#   Live site    → comment it out:
#     # /*    /under-construction.html    200!
#
# Why 200! (forced rewrite): Netlify serves existing files (e.g. index.html)
# before a plain 200 rewrite. The trailing ! forces the rewrite so every path,
# including /, serves under-construction.html instead of the live site.

/*    /under-construction.html    200!
